# Player projectile: dense physics sphere carrying a small team-0 field bubble — the per-emitter
# applied-force readback makes enemy fields decelerate/deflect it in flight (the testbed force-ball
# mechanism). Spawned by GamePlayer::tickCombat, aged out after "Projectile lifetime".
Prefab gameProjectile
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer wireshapes
		Node Sphere
		Type StaticMesh
		Scale 0.2
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Sphere
		Radius 0.2
		Density 400
		Restitution 0.3
		ContactEvents true
	Component Force
		Team 0
		Output 0.4
		Reach 1.5
		Centered true
